#: setup.php
msgid "Hourly at specified minutes"
msgstr "Isan'ora amin'ny minitra voafaritra"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an hourly basis, put the minutes of the hour when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 43 would equal 40 minutes past the hour."
msgstr "Raha tianao ny Cacti hanondrana sary tsy mihetsika isan'ora, apetraho eto ny minitra ao anatin'ny ora hanaovana izany. Mihevitra ny Cacti fa mandefa ny script fanangonana angona isaky ny 5 minitra ianao, ka haravony amin'ny sanda akaiky indrindra amin'ny fotoana fiasany ny sandanao. Ohatra, ny 43 dia hitovy amin'ny 40 minitra aorian'ny ora."

#: setup.php
msgid "Daily at specified time"
msgstr "Isan'andro amin'ny ora voatondro"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an daily basis, put here the time when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 21:23 would equal 20 minutes after 9 PM."
msgstr "Raha tianao ny Cacti hanondrana sary tsy mihetsika isan'andro, apetraho eto ny ora hanaovana izany. Mihevitra ny Cacti fa mandefa ny script fanangonana angona isaky ny 5 minitra ianao, ka haravony amin'ny sanda akaiky indrindra amin'ny fotoana fiasany ny sandanao. Ohatra, ny 21:23 dia hitovy amin'ny 20 minitra aorian'ny 9 ora alina."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use x Threads"
msgstr "Ampiasao ny Threads x"

#: setup.php
msgid "How many background threads do you wish Cacti to use when exporting graphs.  Default is 0 to run all export in poller thread, 1 or more to spawn separate background threads"
msgstr "Firy ny background threads tianao hampiasain'ny Cacti rehefa manondrana kisary.  Ny mahazatra dia 0 mba handefasana ny fanondranana rehetra ao amin'ny poller thread, 1 na mihoatra mba hamoronana background threads misaraka"

