#: setup.php
msgid "The user name to utilize for establishing permissions to Cacti Graphs.  This user name will be used to determine which Graphs/Trees can be exported.  N/A means don't assume any security is in place."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny mpampiasa hampiasaina hametrahana ny fahazoan-dalana amin'ny Kisary Cacti. Ity anaran'ny mpampiasa ity no hampiasaina hamaritana izay Kisary/Hazo azo aondrana. Ny N/A dia midika hoe aza mihevitra fa misy fiarovana napetraka."

#: setup.php
msgid "The Tree(s) to export."
