#: setup.php
msgid "Expand Devices/Sites"
msgstr "Velaro ny Fitaovana/Toerana"

#: setup.php
msgid "This setting determines if Tree Devices and Site Templates and Devices will be expanded or not.  If set to expanded, each host will have a sub-folder containing either Graph Templates or Data Query items."
msgstr "Ity fandrindrana ity no mamaritra raha hivelatra na tsia ny Fitaovana ao amin'ny Hazo sy ny Modely ary Fitaovana ao amin'ny Toerana. Raha apetraka ho mivelatra, ny mpampiantrano tsirairay dia hanana zana-lahatahiry misy na Modely Kisary na singa Data Query."

