#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory, either on the local system or on the remote system, that will contain the exported data."
msgstr "Ity ny lahatahiry, na eo amin'ny rafitra eo an-toerana na eo amin'ny rafitra lavitra, izay hitahiry ny angona naondrana."

#: setup.php
msgid "Local Scratch Directory"
msgstr "Lahatahiry vonjimaika an-toerana"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory that Cacti will temporarily store output prior to sending to the remote site via the transfer method.  The contents of this directory will be deleted after the data is transferred."
msgstr "Ity ny lahatahiry hitahirizan'ny Cacti vonjimaika ny vokatra alohan'ny handefasana azy any amin'ny toerana lavitra amin'ny alalan'ny fomba famindrana. Hofafana ny ao anatin'ity lahatahiry ity rehefa voafindra ny angona."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Options"
msgstr "Safidy lavitra"

#: setup.php
msgid "Sanitize remote directory"
msgstr "Diovy ny lahatahiry lavitra"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to delete any existing files in the FTP remote directory. This option is in use only when using the PHP built-in ftp functions."
msgstr "Mariho ity raha tianao hamafa izay rakitra efa misy ao amin'ny lahatahiry lavitra FTP. Tsy miasa ity safidy ity raha tsy rehefa mampiasa ireo fiasa ftp anatiny ao amin'ny PHP."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Host"
msgstr "Mpampiantrano lavitra"

#: setup.php
msgid "Denotes the host to send Exported Graphs to."
msgstr "Manondro ny mpampiantrano handefasana ny Kisary naondrana."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Port"
msgstr "Seranana lavitra"

#: setup.php
msgid "Communication port to use for the export method if non-standard (leave empty for defaults)."
msgstr "Seranana fifandraisana ampiasaina amin'ny fomba fanondranana raha tsy mahazatra (avelao ho banga raha hampiasa ny mahazatra)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use passive mode"
msgstr "Ampiasao ny fomba passive"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to connect in passive mode to the FTP server."
msgstr "Mariho ity raha tianao hifandray amin'ny fomba passive amin'ny lohamilina FTP."

#: setup.php
msgid "User"
msgstr "Mpampiasa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Account to logon on the remote server (leave empty for defaults)."
msgstr "Kaonty hidirana amin'ny lohamilina lavitra (avelao ho banga ho an'ny sanda mahazatra)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Tenimiafina"

#: setup.php
msgid "Password for the remote ftp account (leave empty for blank)."
msgstr "Tenimiafina ho an'ny kaonty ftp lavitra (avelao ho foana raha tsy misy)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Private Key Path"
msgstr "Lalan'ny fanalahidy manokana"

#: setup.php
msgid "For SCP and RSYNC, enter the Private Key path if required."
msgstr "Ho an'ny SCP sy RSYNC, ampidiro ny lalan'ny fanalahidy manokana raha ilaina."

#: setup.php
msgid "Exported Cacti Graph Pages"
msgstr "Pejin'ny Kisary Cacti naondrana"

#: setup.php
msgid "(Edit)"
msgstr "(Fanovana)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Hetsika"

